{"ID":"20240314091956-5qd96ny","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091956-5qd96ny","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091956-5qd96ny\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163734-q6uy1su\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163756-mv88h86\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:742,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163756-mv88h86\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:61,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:61\u0026#125;","title":"【越婢汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422163734-q6uy1su","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-q6uy1su","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风水，恶风，一身悉肿，脉浮不渴，续自汗出，无大热，越婢汤方之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-jcb7s4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-jcb7s4y","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"越婢汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-4an7n46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-4an7n46","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄六两，石膏半斤，生病三两，甘草二两，大枣十二枚右五味，以水六升，先煮麻黄，去上沫，内诸药，煮取三升，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-a2769n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-a2769n1","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"分温三服。恶风加附子一枚。风水加术四两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-ib1rtvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-ib1rtvs","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"风水呢，是水病的最初显的症状。水病初起，就是两个方子。一个是防己黄芪汤，第二个是越婢汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-0vdry3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-0vdry3u","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越婢汤在用的时候呢，在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"伤寒论里面有介绍过越婢汤，主力呢是汗出，自汗出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你说老师越婢汤里面有麻黄，居然流汗了还在用麻黄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这就是经方家看法不一样，流汗的时候麻黄可以止汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个越婢汤呢，为什么会有“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一身悉肿，脉浮不渴，续自汗出"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，这就是因为肺里面呢，这个东西堵在肺里面，肺热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当肺里面很热的时候，表呢又束到，所以看起来没有大热，实际上这个没有大热的原因是因为伏热，热伏在肺里面，所以说常常会有一点点汗流出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-3bsuqrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-3bsuqrv","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我常常看到病人，不见得一定是风水，有时候太阳表症伤寒表症的时候，摸到脉是浮的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人说全身很难过啊，有流汗，口渴不渴？不渴。脉又比较数，这个时候我已经开越婢汤了。病人如果有恶风呢很严重，我们的桂枝二越婢一汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸如此类，做处方的加减，都可以。这个越婢汤用的很多，但是一定要记得，病人有表症，同时有汗。这个地方的麻黄呢是敛汗的，吃下去反而汗没有。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那会用到石膏，就因为里面壮热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，处方的时候，诸位呢处方用石膏的时候，用两，不要用钱，麻黄用三钱，石膏要用剂量到上两的。越婢汤证的时候，当你看到病人有越婢汤证，因为越婢汤是肺里面很燥热，你舌苔给我看看，舌苔拿出来是黄的，干的，病人会很燥热。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-yba5b7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-yba5b7m","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面呢，诸位看哦，如果说加减，越婢汤的加减，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果分温三服，病人恶风，恶风就是表虚掉了，因为吃了越婢汤有时候表虚掉，病人如果恶风的话，我们加附子，把表把它固住，风水的时候，再加白术，越婢加术汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。越婢加术汤用的时候呢一般来说，都是我们发现到病人肌肉关节里面累积很多湿，我们才会越婢汤去加白术在里面，否则光是肺里面有大热，身体没有沉重的话，一般来说我们都不会去开加了白术在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163734-ctk8goq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163734-ctk8goq","updated":"20240422163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然了越婢加术汤是一个很有名的治疗全身发黄的一个处方，后面介绍到黄疸病的时候，我们会介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163755-0024t0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163755-0024t0u"}},{"ID":"20240422163756-98d16g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-98d16g8","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"风水，恶风，一身悉肿，脉浮不渴，续自汗出，无大热，越婢汤方之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-hu7teaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-hu7teaq","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"越婢汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-l50at1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-l50at1f","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄六两，石膏半斤，生病三两，甘草二两，大枣十二枚右五味，以水六升，先煮麻黄，去上沫，内诸药，煮取三升，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-o5uyjrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-o5uyjrf","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"分温三服。恶风加附子一枚。风水加术四两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-q0guvxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-q0guvxr","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来呢，开始治证，我们有风水，皮水，有里水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这两个处方我是一天到晚在用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-77xsl7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-77xsl7k","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个风水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脉浮身重"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这两个都是风水，老师你看这两个都是风水。差别在哪里？差别在身重，有身重就要用这个防己黄芪汤，无身重我们就用越婢汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们来看，脉浮身重，汗出恶风者，防己黄芪汤主之，腹痛者加芍药，那同样的，如果一个人，呼吸很短，短气者我们加麻黄，对不对？诸如此类，有咳呢，加点杏仁，加减就是这样子。大家现在看到这个风水，防己黄芪汤呢，它的汤方是这个样子，防己一两，黄芪一两，白术五钱，炙甘草五钱。为什么要这样做？因为白术可以去它的湿，身重代表病在脾脏上面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾呢，主四肢，脾主肌肉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。现在呢，病人湿很盛，水湿很盛，停在肌肉里面，所以这个肌肉没有办法把这个水代谢掉，当它没有把它代谢掉的时候，就重，重的时候为什么会病人会汗出？因为湿阻在肌肉..."}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-s88yqiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-s88yqiq","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你湿阻在肌肉里的时候，我们身上的水，新的水要去取代旧的水，这就是新陈代谢。可是呢中间有个湿挡到，因为肌肉是全身的嘛，肌肉到处都有，由于肌肉里面湿很多，那新的水就没有办法去代谢旧的水，旧的水停在那边排不出去，所以病人就会有脉浮身重的现象。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那病人不断在流汗，所以他这个流汗啊，实际上是因为湿太盛而造成的流汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人来的时候...我们在美国碰到很多，这种病是冷气病，常常呆在冷气间里面，然后或者是他工作的时候一下到那个......冷冻库里面搬东西一下又跑出来又很热，来回跑来回跑，结果表汗没有透发，表汗没有透发的时候，慢慢湿就累积在身体里面去。病人来的时候就会讲，我身体很重，走路你可以看他动作就很重，有一次呢，我就看到一个病人，一看汗出身重，我就开防己黄芪汤，一味药加减都没有，就是这四味药，给他吃一个礼拜。回来他说，全部好了，第一天吃完统统好了，身重流汗都没有，统统好了。病人就是还有 stress（压力），人很沮丧，压力很大，吃西药，吃到忧郁，那么跟这个病就没有关系，所以防己黄芪汤非常好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-mzco7rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-mzco7rl","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那由于湿呆在身上会造成人虚胖，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以诸位如果觉得小腹微突，可以吃吃防己黄芪汤，效果很好，吃了就知道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那你偷偷吃就好不要讲出来。这个，还有呢，我在临床上治疗淋巴癌的时候，淋巴肿瘤的时候，你看防己厉不厉害...在中医的观念里面呢，它认为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己入三焦系统，所以防己能够通利三焦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那茯苓呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓这个药呢为什么能够利水？因为茯苓能够生油，三焦油网里面的油"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以如果三焦里面有累积到东西填在三焦里面的时候，那一定是水的气化，水的水道堵塞到了，水道为什么堵塞？你绝对不可能说你吃的猪大肠或者吃的豆腐干吃的饭跑到三焦里面堵到的，不可能的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦是水道，所以当你湿很盛的时候，这个水道堵到，这个湿一定是痰，痰堵到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以病人出现淋巴系统有东西堵到的时候，大家不要紧张，他一定是痰凝，那个水太浓了，变成痰堵在那个地方，所以说我在处方的时候防己，茯苓，我还加上瓦楞子，瓦楞子呢，比如说我用到五钱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么会选择瓦楞子呢？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-zrlfsvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-zrlfsvy","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子专门去这个痰饮，效果很好，那消积，有痰积到身体里面去，瓦楞子（可以消除）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。现在再回头，如果一个女孩子乳房里面有硬块，是不是就是瓦楞子。一样啊，你把它想成痰水就好了。如果结石很硬一块，排不出来的时候，经方呢这个我们还有很多药啊可以选择，用牡蛎，牡蛎可以软坚，你说老师这牡蛎呢用多少，你有没有听说吃牡蛎死掉的？没有嘛，一两。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不要小气用药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你知道这个药可以攻坚，因为牡蛎是味咸，咸能软坚，所以大剂的用牡蛎，配合防己通利三焦，茯苓..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人如果有身重，加上白术，如果有汗出，人气虚的时候，加黄芪，这就是你的加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-ze4tuqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-ze4tuqs","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我曾经治疗淋巴癌，淋巴肿瘤。病人没有，为什么我叫病人不要动刀？诸位这样子想，你如果说今天去切片，本来你的你的经脉是这样子，这个是三焦系统，结果你去切个片，这里面有个硬块（图示经脉三焦里），可能是西医名词的结缔组织，这里被切片以后，当我们的药攻进去的时候，没有切片的地方统统去掉了，就在切片的位置会造成阻塞，所以我们不赞成去切片。中医呢，是站在外面看到里面藏什么的东西，比如说你摸到这淋巴结它的表面是圆滑的，滑滑的，圆的，皮肤表面摸上去那个硬块是非常的圆滑，滑利的，平的。这只是一般的良性的肿瘤。但如果你摸到表面是很粗糙的，很硬，像石头一样，这是癌症。治疗方法呢，一样。只是剂量要加重而已，加重剂量而已。不管是乳癌、淋巴癌，方法都用这种方法，效果非常的好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163756-mv88h86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163756-mv88h86","updated":"20240422163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上大家看的时候，吃一剂，一个礼拜以后，大部分都走掉了，只有切片那部分硬块还有，这很麻烦，所以不知道的最好不要去动它。"}]}]}